{"id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md","title":"ZFC Iteration Tree","display":"df-zfc-iteration-tree — ZFC Iteration Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-iteration-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-iteration-tree — ZFC Iteration Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-direct-limit]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-tree]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-limitordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-iteration-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-iteration-tree — ZFC Iteration Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3a9f5d3a8e080215\" href=\"?note=3a9f5d3a8e080215\" title=\"58-df-direct-limit\">58-df-direct-limit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T,M,\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i,p,\\beta\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i,p,\\beta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pred}:V^3\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{Pred}:V^3\\to V\\)</span> is the strict-predecessor operator supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"58-df-tree\">58-df-tree</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S:V^6\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S:V^6\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> is the exact six-place relation from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3a9f5d3a8e080215\" href=\"?note=3a9f5d3a8e080215\" title=\"58-df-direct-limit\">58-df-direct-limit</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ImmediatePred}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\operatorname{ImmediatePred}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (set-theoretic predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> denotes the fine-structural extender-ultrapower construction, including its well-founded collapse and canonical embedding; no set code for this construction is supplied by the present dependency graph</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> is retained as a metasyntactic predicate because one of its defining clauses invokes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}tree\\text{-}immediate\\text{-}predecessor}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ImmediatePred}_S(p,\\beta,\\theta,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow p,\\beta\\in\\theta\\land p\\neq\\beta\n\\land\\langle p,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\nu\\neq p\\land u\\neq\\beta\n\\land\\langle p,u\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\langle u,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}tree\\text{-}immediate\\text{-}predecessor}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ImmediatePred}_S(p,\\beta,\\theta,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow p,\\beta\\in\\theta\\land p\\neq\\beta\n\\land\\langle p,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\nu\\neq p\\land u\\neq\\beta\n\\land\\langle p,u\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\langle u,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}tree}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i,B_M,B_E,B_i\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal T=\\langle\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land 0\\in\\theta\\land\\mathrm{Tree}(\\theta,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,\\theta,B_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec E,\\{\\alpha\\in\\theta:\\alpha+1\\in\\theta\\},B_E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\n(\\vec i,\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\theta^2:\n\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\},B_i)\n\\land\\vec M(0)=M\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\n\\vec i(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\vec M(\\alpha)}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\to\n\\vec i(\\langle\\alpha,\\gamma\\rangle)\n=\\vec i(\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle)\\circ\n\\vec i(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\alpha+1\\in\\theta\\to\n\\exists!p\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ImmediatePred}_S(p,\\alpha+1,\\theta,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14em}\\land\n\\operatorname{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(\\vec M(\\alpha+1),\\vec i(\\langle p,\\alpha+1\\rangle),\n\\vec M(p),\\vec E(\\alpha))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\n\\exists P,\\phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nP=\\operatorname{Pred}(\\theta,R,\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\n\\phi=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\vec i(\\langle\\alpha,\\lambda\\rangle)\\rangle:\\alpha\\in P\\}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S\n(\\vec M(\\lambda),\\phi,\n\\vec M\\upharpoonright P,\n\\vec i\\upharpoonright(P\\times P),\nP,R\\upharpoonright P^2)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}tree}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i,B_M,B_E,B_i\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal T=\\langle\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land 0\\in\\theta\\land\\mathrm{Tree}(\\theta,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,\\theta,B_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec E,\\{\\alpha\\in\\theta:\\alpha+1\\in\\theta\\},B_E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\n(\\vec i,\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\theta^2:\n\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\},B_i)\n\\land\\vec M(0)=M\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\n\\vec i(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\vec M(\\alpha)}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\to\n\\vec i(\\langle\\alpha,\\gamma\\rangle)\n=\\vec i(\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle)\\circ\n\\vec i(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\alpha+1\\in\\theta\\to\n\\exists!p\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ImmediatePred}_S(p,\\alpha+1,\\theta,R)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14em}\\land\n\\operatorname{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(\\vec M(\\alpha+1),\\vec i(\\langle p,\\alpha+1\\rangle),\n\\vec M(p),\\vec E(\\alpha))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\n\\exists P,\\phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nP=\\operatorname{Pred}(\\theta,R,\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\n\\phi=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\vec i(\\langle\\alpha,\\lambda\\rangle)\\rangle:\\alpha\\in P\\}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S\n(\\vec M(\\lambda),\\phi,\n\\vec M\\upharpoonright P,\n\\vec i\\upharpoonright(P\\times P),\nP,R\\upharpoonright P^2)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order-theoretic skeleton, immediate-predecessor relation, coherent branch embeddings, predecessor cone, and limit-stage cocone are explicitly set-coded.  The root is excluded from the limit-stage clause.</li>\n<li>The dependency graph contains only the ordinary set-model ultrapower atom, not an extender sequence, fine-structural ultrapower, well-founded collapse, or drop data.  Consequently the successor-stage clause and hence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\)</span> are honestly marked metasyntactic; they must not be read as a ZFC-internal definition until those missing codes are supplied.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-direct-limit","status":"resolved","id":"3a9f5d3a8e080215","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-direct-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-limitordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Pred}:V^3\\to V$ is the strict-predecessor operator supplied by [[58-df-tree]], and $\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S:V^6\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ is the exact six-place relation from [[58-df-direct-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-direct-limit","status":"resolved","id":"3a9f5d3a8e080215","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Pred}:V^3\\to V$ is the strict-predecessor operator supplied by [[58-df-tree]], and $\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S:V^6\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ is the exact six-place relation from [[58-df-direct-limit]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T,M,\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i,p,\\beta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tree}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pred}:V^3\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S:V^6\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ImmediatePred}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}tree\\text{-}immediate\\text{-}predecessor}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ImmediatePred}_S(p,\\beta,\\theta,R)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow p,\\beta\\in\\theta\\land p\\neq\\beta\n\\land\\langle p,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\nu\\neq p\\land u\\neq\\beta\n\\land\\langle p,u\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\langle u,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}tree}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i,B_M,B_E,B_i\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal T=\\langle\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land 0\\in\\theta\\land\\mathrm{Tree}(\\theta,R)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,\\theta,B_M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec E,\\{\\alpha\\in\\theta:\\alpha+1\\in\\theta\\},B_E)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}\n(\\vec i,\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\theta^2:\n\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\},B_i)\n\\land\\vec M(0)=M\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\n\\vec i(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\vec M(\\alpha)}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle\\in R\\\\\n&\\hspace{12em}\\to\n\\vec i(\\langle\\alpha,\\gamma\\rangle)\n=\\vec i(\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle)\\circ\n\\vec i(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\alpha+1\\in\\theta\\to\n\\exists!p\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ImmediatePred}_S(p,\\alpha+1,\\theta,R)\\\\\n&\\hspace{14em}\\land\n\\operatorname{ExtenderUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(\\vec M(\\alpha+1),\\vec i(\\langle p,\\alpha+1\\rangle),\n\\vec M(p),\\vec E(\\alpha))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\theta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\n\\exists P,\\phi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nP=\\operatorname{Pred}(\\theta,R,\\lambda)\\\\\n&\\hspace{10em}\\land\n\\phi=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\vec i(\\langle\\alpha,\\lambda\\rangle)\\rangle:\\alpha\\in P\\}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S\n(\\vec M(\\lambda),\\phi,\n\\vec M\\upharpoonright P,\n\\vec i\\upharpoonright(P\\times P),\nP,R\\upharpoonright P^2)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S","display":false}],"bytes":